WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.059
- [Mark] Lydia.

00:00:01.059 --> 00:00:01.892
- Yes.

00:00:01.892 --> 00:00:02.870
- [Mark] Lydia where
are you from originally?

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:03.703
Where'd you grow up?

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.080
- Santa Barbara.

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:06.400
- [Mark] And tell me about your family.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.760
You grew up with both of your parents?

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:08.722
- [Lydia] No,

00:00:08.722 --> 00:00:09.555
just my mom.

00:00:09.555 --> 00:00:10.820
- [Mark] Just your mom.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:11.653
Where was dad?

00:00:11.653 --> 00:00:12.710
- I don't know,

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:13.543
he took off.

00:00:13.543 --> 00:00:14.626
- [Mark] You never knew?

00:00:14.626 --> 00:00:15.650
- No.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:17.410
- [Mark] And how was your childhood?

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:18.243
- Hard.

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:21.060
- [Mark] What were the
hard parts about it?

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:21.893
- Being raised.

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:25.453
- [Mark] Were there were problems with,

00:00:26.408 --> 00:00:27.980
with your mom or-

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:30.110
- Yeah, she's an alcoholic.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:31.230
- [Mark] Oh your mom's alcoholic?

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:32.063
- Yeah.

00:00:33.234 --> 00:00:34.243
- [Mark] And what kind of of stuff went on

00:00:34.243 --> 00:00:36.060
when you were a kid?

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:37.642
- A lot of abuse,

00:00:37.642 --> 00:00:38.980
a lot of abuse.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:39.980
Name calling.

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:40.813
- [Mark] What kind,

00:00:40.813 --> 00:00:41.646
what kind of abuse?

00:00:41.646 --> 00:00:44.333
- Mentally, emotionally even physically.

00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:45.370
- [Mark] From your mom?

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:46.500
- Yeah and my sisters,

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:47.333
yeah.

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:48.374
- [Mark] And your sisters too?

00:00:48.374 --> 00:00:49.207
- Yeah.

00:00:51.062 --> 00:00:54.400
My mom didn't me when I was a baby.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.370
She had me with my dad

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:58.590
and my dad didn't want
anything to do with her so,

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:00.040
I'm the reject of the family.

00:01:02.127 --> 00:01:03.242
- [Mark] Are you the youngest?

00:01:03.242 --> 00:01:04.096
- No I'm the middle.

00:01:04.096 --> 00:01:05.437
- [Mark] You're in the middle?

00:01:05.437 --> 00:01:08.310
But what made you feel
like you weren't wanted?

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:09.235
- She told me.

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:10.068
(chuckles)

00:01:10.068 --> 00:01:11.130
- [Mark] That would do it.

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:11.980
That would do it.

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:15.603
What age were you when you left home?

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:18.200
- 15.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.033
- [Mark] 15.

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:22.690
How bad did the

00:01:22.690 --> 00:01:23.523
abuse get?

00:01:23.523 --> 00:01:24.356
I mean,

00:01:24.356 --> 00:01:25.189
what kind of stuff,

00:01:25.189 --> 00:01:26.232
what happened?

00:01:26.232 --> 00:01:27.154
- You mean my family

00:01:27.154 --> 00:01:27.987
or out here?

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:28.820
- [Mark] With your mom,

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:30.400
with your family.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.470
- Well,

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:34.062
she tried taking my life like a few times.

00:01:34.062 --> 00:01:35.160
You know?

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:36.299
She-

00:01:36.299 --> 00:01:37.132
- [Mark] She tried to what?

00:01:37.132 --> 00:01:37.965
- Take my life.

00:01:37.965 --> 00:01:38.798
- [Mark] Take your life?

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:39.631
- Yeah.

00:01:39.631 --> 00:01:40.464
- [Mark] How would she do that?

00:01:40.464 --> 00:01:41.470
- She put a knife to me one time

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:44.430
when I was a young teenager.

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:45.263
When I was baby,

00:01:45.263 --> 00:01:46.693
she tried to drown me.

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:50.803
And when I was a young adult,

00:01:50.803 --> 00:01:52.038
she threw me out her car.

00:01:52.038 --> 00:01:54.175
(chuckles)

00:01:54.175 --> 00:01:55.519
- [Mark] When you were a young adult what?

00:01:55.519 --> 00:01:56.997
- She threw me out of the car.

00:01:56.997 --> 00:01:58.200
She pushed me out of the car.

00:01:58.200 --> 00:01:59.520
- [Mark] Pushed you out of a car?

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:00.353
- Yeah.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:03.110
- [Mark] Did she treat your,

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:04.457
you have sisters?

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:05.290
- No.

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:06.123
- [Mark] Or brothers?

00:02:06.123 --> 00:02:07.370
- No, they're the pedestals.

00:02:07.370 --> 00:02:08.220
They were high up there

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:09.110
and I was down here.

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:10.597
I was the ugly one.

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:14.110
- [Mark] Did she treat them the same way

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:15.150
she treated you?

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:16.018
- No.

00:02:16.018 --> 00:02:17.167
Just you.

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:19.660
- [Mark] So when you left home at 15,

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:20.493
where'd you go?

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:22.273
- The streets.

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:25.600
I found family there.

00:02:28.284 --> 00:02:29.534
I don't like it

00:02:30.497 --> 00:02:32.395
but I felt I fit in.

00:02:32.395 --> 00:02:33.230
- [Mark] Yeah.

00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:34.210
Did you join a gang?

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:35.150
- No never.

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:35.983
- [Mark] No.

00:02:35.983 --> 00:02:36.816
Just people on the street that

00:02:36.816 --> 00:02:38.960
became your new family.

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:39.793
- Yeah

00:02:39.793 --> 00:02:40.639
but most of the time

00:02:40.639 --> 00:02:41.472
I was by myself,

00:02:41.472 --> 00:02:43.030
I'm alone.

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:44.180
Being out here is hard.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:48.790
I have a lot of testimonies,

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:50.170
you know?

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:51.520
3 years ago I was kidnapped

00:02:52.763 --> 00:02:54.939
and I was tortured out here pretty bad.

00:02:54.939 --> 00:02:56.856
- [Mark] What happened?

00:02:57.830 --> 00:02:59.480
- They grabbed a hold of me.

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:00.313
It was two girls

00:03:00.313 --> 00:03:01.146
and two guys.

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:04.060
They spread me apart

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:04.910
and they beat me.

00:03:06.458 --> 00:03:07.830
They took my teeth out,

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:08.723
they burned me.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.100
Hated my hair,

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:11.933
broke my ribs,

00:03:11.933 --> 00:03:12.766
my face.

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:14.703
They took my soul.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:17.260
Took my spirit,

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:18.093
you know?

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:19.983
I'm not racist

00:03:19.983 --> 00:03:21.400
but I'm scared of black people.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:25.987
I might be one of the harmless

00:03:25.987 --> 00:03:27.640
people out here.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:28.599
See I forgive them,

00:03:28.599 --> 00:03:31.040
I forgive everybody.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:31.873
But,

00:03:34.285 --> 00:03:35.897
I'm just by myself you know?

00:03:35.897 --> 00:03:37.490
I'm tryna get into housing,

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:39.730
trying to get myself together.

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:41.100
- [Mark] Are you using any drugs?

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:42.120
- Marijuana.

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:42.953
- [Mark] That's it?

00:03:42.953 --> 00:03:43.786
- I smoke marijuana.

00:03:43.786 --> 00:03:44.619
I used to do heroin

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:46.850
but I've been clean

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:47.850
10 years.

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:49.373
- [Mark] You've been clean
off heroin for 10 years?

00:03:49.373 --> 00:03:50.206
- Yeah off the streets,

00:03:50.206 --> 00:03:51.039
I quit cold turkey

00:03:51.039 --> 00:03:52.210
on San Julian

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:53.690
at the Drop-in Center.

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:54.930
- [Mark] Is it how you got clean?

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:55.763
- Yeah.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:57.670
Cold turkey

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:01.198
and I never went back to it again.

00:04:01.198 --> 00:04:02.533
- [Mark] You're one of the fewest

00:04:02.533 --> 00:04:04.474
that ever would say that.

00:04:04.474 --> 00:04:05.391
- You know,

00:04:06.607 --> 00:04:08.607
being out here 28 years,

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:10.723
by the grace of God

00:04:10.723 --> 00:04:11.950
I still have my sanity you know?

00:04:13.177 --> 00:04:15.918
And this place does seem to shock me,

00:04:15.918 --> 00:04:16.810
you know?

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:17.643
It sickens me,

00:04:17.643 --> 00:04:18.476
it saddens.

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:20.990
The way things are happening now.

00:04:22.020 --> 00:04:23.198
With everything that's going around,

00:04:23.198 --> 00:04:24.031
you know?

00:04:24.031 --> 00:04:25.863
- [Mark] How many years
have you been in Skid Row?

00:04:25.863 --> 00:04:26.826
- 28 years.

00:04:26.826 --> 00:04:27.659
[Mark] 28 years?

00:04:27.659 --> 00:04:28.657
- 28 years.

00:04:28.657 --> 00:04:30.328
- [Mark] Jesus.

00:04:30.328 --> 00:04:31.303
And how old are you?

00:04:31.303 --> 00:04:32.342
- I'm 52.

00:04:32.342 --> 00:04:33.175
- [Mark] 52.

00:04:33.175 --> 00:04:34.200
Did you have kids?

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.730
- I have two boys.

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:36.563
- [Mark] Did you raise them?

00:04:36.563 --> 00:04:37.693
- Yeah somewhat.

00:04:41.608 --> 00:04:43.020
Being out here,

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:43.853
I've heard things

00:04:43.853 --> 00:04:44.686
I didn't want to hear.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:47.083
I've see things

00:04:47.083 --> 00:04:48.123
that I didn't even wanna see.

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:51.789
Things have happened to me

00:04:51.789 --> 00:04:53.689
that I don't wish upon my worst enemy.

00:04:55.333 --> 00:04:59.850
But I'm okay you know?

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:00.683
About a month ago,

00:05:00.683 --> 00:05:01.600
I was hit by a car.

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:03.763
It was on purpose.

00:05:08.298 --> 00:05:09.131
I got,

00:05:09.131 --> 00:05:10.510
you know his information

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:12.319
so I'm getting me up out of here,

00:05:12.319 --> 00:05:13.152
you know?

00:05:13.152 --> 00:05:13.985
I don't wanna ask for to much,

00:05:13.985 --> 00:05:15.720
I don't wanna ask for too little.

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:16.553
Just what's fair,

00:05:16.553 --> 00:05:17.386
you know?

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:19.302
See my family again,

00:05:19.302 --> 00:05:20.135
you know?

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.870
- [Mark] Do you still talk to your kids?

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:24.922
- They're mad at me right now.

00:05:24.922 --> 00:05:25.755
They're,

00:05:25.755 --> 00:05:26.870
they're kind of stern hard,

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:27.703
tough love.

00:05:29.394 --> 00:05:30.300
But I do keep in contact-

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:31.133
- [Mark] But they're mad at you

00:05:31.133 --> 00:05:32.040
for what reason now?

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:33.820
If you're clean off heroin.

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:34.970
- Because I'm out here.

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:37.249
But they don't open the door to me,

00:05:37.249 --> 00:05:38.210
to me either

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:42.920
You know?

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.220
I don't wanna bother them.

00:05:47.968 --> 00:05:48.801
It's just hard out here,

00:05:48.801 --> 00:05:50.296
you know?

00:05:50.296 --> 00:05:51.946
And it's even more dangerous now.

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:54.513
Everybody's dying out here.

00:05:55.855 --> 00:05:56.920
- [Mark] You've been here 28 years,

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:58.061
What kind stuff have you seen?

00:05:58.061 --> 00:05:59.308
What have you seen?

00:05:59.308 --> 00:06:00.193
- Rapes.

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:04.323
Brutal murders.

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:09.800
Men beating up on women.

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:12.043
Men raping men.

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:15.523
Animals being abused.

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:18.783
People literally shitting

00:06:18.783 --> 00:06:21.093
and sleeping on crap.

00:06:21.093 --> 00:06:23.510
(car engine)

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:27.533
People on spice.

00:06:29.651 --> 00:06:32.202
That really kicks my butt.

00:06:32.202 --> 00:06:35.175
'cause I've had 4 friends
die on spice already.

00:06:35.175 --> 00:06:36.273
- [Mark] It's an awful drug.

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:38.510
So why did you still live here

00:06:38.510 --> 00:06:40.083
if you're not doing heroin?

00:06:41.061 --> 00:06:43.161
- Because I don't feel I fit into society.

00:06:46.063 --> 00:06:47.453
Society is hard.

00:06:49.310 --> 00:06:50.293
People are cruel.

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:52.180
You know,

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.440
I should be used to the name calling

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:54.273
but I'm not.

00:06:57.131 --> 00:06:57.964
It still hurts,

00:06:57.964 --> 00:06:59.130
you know?

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:00.620
People look at me

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:01.570
like I'm a monster.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:07.550
And here they don't do that.

00:07:09.555 --> 00:07:10.388
- [Mark] Do you think the way

00:07:10.388 --> 00:07:11.290
that you were raised,

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:13.370
the way your mom treated you is,

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:15.014
has a part to play in that?

00:07:15.014 --> 00:07:16.429
- Yeah.

00:07:16.429 --> 00:07:18.879
- [Mark] Your self-perception is-

00:07:18.879 --> 00:07:20.189
- My self esteem-

00:07:20.189 --> 00:07:21.022
- [Mark] Yes,

00:07:21.022 --> 00:07:21.855
it's just so low that you,

00:07:21.855 --> 00:07:23.293
you think this is where you belong.

00:07:23.293 --> 00:07:24.126
- Yeah.

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:32.263
Thank you.

00:07:39.326 --> 00:07:41.538
- [Mark] What are you doing for money now?

00:07:41.538 --> 00:07:43.157
- I recycle.

00:07:43.157 --> 00:07:44.350
I recycle cans.

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:45.933
It's never much.

00:07:49.495 --> 00:07:50.917
I'll,

00:07:50.917 --> 00:07:53.140
I'll hook somebody's tan up for them.

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:53.990
You know I'll hook it up for them

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:55.100
and they'll pay me or whatever,

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:55.933
a couple dollars.

00:07:55.933 --> 00:07:56.766
- [Mark] In the past,

00:07:56.766 --> 00:07:57.623
have you done other things for money?

00:07:58.810 --> 00:07:59.643
- No,

00:07:59.643 --> 00:08:00.570
I don't steal,

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:01.563
I don't prostitute,

00:08:02.470 --> 00:08:03.581
I don't take from people,

00:08:03.581 --> 00:08:07.438
I don't take things
that don't belong to me.

00:08:07.438 --> 00:08:09.000
I don't like stealers you know.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.762
I'd been mistaken for somebody,

00:08:10.762 --> 00:08:11.710
for somebody else

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:14.633
and they tried to assassinate me.

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:16.670
They wanted to kill me.

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:17.516
Because I was thought

00:08:17.516 --> 00:08:18.450
I was like somebody else.

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:19.920
A few times.

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:21.704
And when the truth finally came out,

00:08:21.704 --> 00:08:23.154
I didn't even get an apology.

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:26.330
People take for me.

00:08:27.903 --> 00:08:28.753
Because they can.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.681
It's hard you know?

00:08:33.681 --> 00:08:35.707
People think it's just that easy,

00:08:35.707 --> 00:08:36.601
it's easy to be homeless,

00:08:36.601 --> 00:08:38.649
it's not.

00:08:38.649 --> 00:08:40.960
(indistinct)

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:42.463
you know my laundry,

00:08:43.630 --> 00:08:44.463
my bedding

00:08:44.463 --> 00:08:45.296
her hygiene,

00:08:45.296 --> 00:08:46.129
my radio,

00:08:46.129 --> 00:08:47.052
my batteries,

00:08:47.052 --> 00:08:47.885
my lights.

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:50.833
My pair of shoes.

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:55.173
But I'm all right you know,

00:08:55.173 --> 00:08:56.333
God takes care of me.

00:08:59.047 --> 00:09:00.293
I'm all right.

00:09:02.252 --> 00:09:04.669
(indistinct)

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:08.150
- [Lydia] I want to puppy.

00:09:09.553 --> 00:09:11.337
I want a puppy so bad it hurts.

00:09:12.709 --> 00:09:13.637
You know I see all these animals

00:09:13.637 --> 00:09:15.043
out here being abused.

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:17.373
For fighting or,

00:09:19.191 --> 00:09:21.550
it's so wrong you know.

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:22.670
I was talking to a couple people

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:24.480
for abusing their animals.

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:29.270
If an animal could talk imagine,

00:09:30.351 --> 00:09:31.184
you know?

00:09:33.524 --> 00:09:34.424
I've been bullied,

00:09:35.610 --> 00:09:36.883
I had a stalker on me.

00:09:38.659 --> 00:09:39.685
About 3 or 4 months ago,

00:09:39.685 --> 00:09:40.685
I was raped.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:51.376
I told the police

00:09:51.376 --> 00:09:53.626
and they didn't do nothing.

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:58.033
They said I probably asked for it.

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:05.162
I've tried to get my house,

00:10:05.162 --> 00:10:06.757
I've been trying for 2 years.

00:10:06.757 --> 00:10:09.100
(car engine)

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:11.033
Except they always tell
me something's wrong.

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:16.140
I'm tired of relationship,

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:18.500
you can't have a relationship out here.

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:19.793
But I'm lonely too.

00:10:26.151 --> 00:10:27.401
I'm just tired.

00:10:29.717 --> 00:10:31.817
I'm tired of havin' to go to sleep scared.

00:10:32.680 --> 00:10:34.608
Sleeping with my shoes on.

00:10:34.608 --> 00:10:36.608
So I can escape and run.

00:10:39.980 --> 00:10:41.680
People turn on you in a heartbeat.

00:10:44.783 --> 00:10:46.333
I have no friends out here.

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:48.900
People know that I'm by myself

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:49.733
so what do they do?

00:10:49.733 --> 00:10:50.643
They take advantage of me.

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:54.120
But they also give a sweater

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:54.953
or a pair of,

00:10:54.953 --> 00:10:55.953
you know a bar of soap.

00:10:59.060 --> 00:11:00.323
To trust someone is hard.

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:09.100
- [Mark] Looking back at your life.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:10.134
What do you,

00:11:10.134 --> 00:11:10.967
what do you wish had played out

00:11:10.967 --> 00:11:13.700
differently that might've
changed your path?

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:14.533
- Peace of mind.

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:17.921
Just to live comfortably

00:11:17.921 --> 00:11:18.754
and live in peace

00:11:18.754 --> 00:11:19.587
and have peace.

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:21.853
Just to be peaceful.

00:11:24.801 --> 00:11:26.443
To have no stress or worries.

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:32.033
Just peace.

00:11:32.033 --> 00:11:32.960
- [Mark] Do you feel like your childhood

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:34.810
was so traumatic that it just kind of

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:37.033
set you back

00:11:37.033 --> 00:11:38.003
and kept you that way?

00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:40.480
And now you're here?

00:11:41.554 --> 00:11:42.387
- Yeah.

00:11:42.387 --> 00:11:43.380
- [Mark] You don't feel like you're

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:44.530
capable of getting out?

00:11:45.770 --> 00:11:46.603
- I'm trying.

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:50.392
But something always sets me back.

00:11:50.392 --> 00:11:51.225
Like I said I was,

00:11:51.225 --> 00:11:52.829
I was hit by the car.

00:11:52.829 --> 00:11:54.255
Then a few weeks after that,

00:11:54.255 --> 00:11:55.088
I fell

00:11:55.088 --> 00:11:56.979
and I had an accident on my bike.

00:11:56.979 --> 00:11:58.646
I messed up my ribs.

00:12:00.171 --> 00:12:01.633
They told me to just relaxing.

00:12:01.633 --> 00:12:02.944
And the medic was telling me to relax.

00:12:02.944 --> 00:12:04.879
But I gotta move.

00:12:04.879 --> 00:12:07.129
No one's been there for me.

00:12:08.102 --> 00:12:08.935
If I don't get up

00:12:08.935 --> 00:12:09.768
and recycle,

00:12:09.768 --> 00:12:10.768
I don't eat.

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:17.683
I buy my things

00:12:17.683 --> 00:12:18.516
just cause people still

00:12:18.516 --> 00:12:19.349
steal my things

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:24.093
It's just not fair,

00:12:24.093 --> 00:12:25.026
you know.

00:12:25.026 --> 00:12:26.622
I don't mess with people.

00:12:26.622 --> 00:12:28.539
I don't take from them.

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:31.770
- [Mark] Do you think you'll stay here

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:32.987
the rest of your life?

00:12:32.987 --> 00:12:35.212
- God I hope not.

00:12:35.212 --> 00:12:36.045
I prayer to God,

00:12:36.045 --> 00:12:37.295
I hope I don't.

00:12:39.445 --> 00:12:40.278
- [Mark] But you've been down here

00:12:40.278 --> 00:12:41.144
for almost 3 decades.

00:12:41.144 --> 00:12:41.977
- I know.

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:50.833
I got sick out here.

00:12:51.840 --> 00:12:52.915
People have been,

00:12:52.915 --> 00:12:54.540
I lot of people dying out here you know,

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.780
overdosing or

00:12:56.780 --> 00:12:58.213
beating or killing or something.

00:12:58.213 --> 00:12:59.373
It's scary.

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:02.851
When I got hit by that car,

00:13:02.851 --> 00:13:03.684
and I was laying

00:13:03.684 --> 00:13:04.517
in the street,

00:13:04.517 --> 00:13:05.350
by myself,

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:08.983
I was scared.

00:13:10.530 --> 00:13:11.363
The only thing I wanted

00:13:11.363 --> 00:13:12.317
was my mom.

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:16.330
- [Mark] Is your mom's still around?

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:17.589
- Yeah.

00:13:17.589 --> 00:13:19.060
- [Mark] Do you talk to her?

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:19.893
- No.

00:13:21.583 --> 00:13:23.577
She's real negative.

00:13:23.577 --> 00:13:25.730
She'll just throw 'em worse at me,

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:26.563
you know?

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:30.560
She'll just throw at me more shit

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:31.860
not making me feel better.

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:34.733
- [Mark] So you don't talk to your mom,

00:13:34.733 --> 00:13:36.080
you don't talk to your kids?

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:38.910
- No I mean I talk to my sister

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:39.807
and my sisters tell the boys

00:13:39.807 --> 00:13:40.640
"hi"

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:41.563
you know,

00:13:41.563 --> 00:13:42.396
and that I love 'em

00:13:42.396 --> 00:13:43.509
and I miss 'em.

00:13:43.509 --> 00:13:44.342
Other than that,

00:13:44.342 --> 00:13:45.851
no I don't talk to them.

00:13:45.851 --> 00:13:49.070
They don't want to talk to me.

00:13:49.070 --> 00:13:50.920
They don't understand why I ran away.

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:54.900
They don't understand why I stay away.

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:02.113
But then again

00:14:02.113 --> 00:14:03.025
I don't expect them to either,

00:14:03.025 --> 00:14:03.858
you know?

00:14:06.557 --> 00:14:08.398
I don't really expect their forgiveness,

00:14:08.398 --> 00:14:09.231
you know?

00:14:12.563 --> 00:14:14.860
Just don't stop loving me.

00:14:14.860 --> 00:14:16.260
I don't wanna give 'em hope.

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:24.243
I'm suicidal.

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:27.653
About,

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:29.743
5 months ago

00:14:29.743 --> 00:14:30.653
I tried hanging myself.

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:34.097
Right there

00:14:34.097 --> 00:14:35.053
in front of everybody.

00:14:35.053 --> 00:14:36.796
- [Mark] What's that?

00:14:36.796 --> 00:14:37.629
- It was at night,

00:14:37.629 --> 00:14:38.712
down San Ped.

00:14:39.767 --> 00:14:41.673
People just walked by.

00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:44.423
Cars just drove by.

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:46.913
Some of 'em just sat there

00:14:46.913 --> 00:14:47.873
and laughed.

00:14:56.188 --> 00:14:57.427
I may become a Jane Doe

00:14:57.427 --> 00:14:58.493
if I stay out here.

00:15:00.746 --> 00:15:01.579
And I not,

00:15:01.579 --> 00:15:04.422
I don't want that to happen to me.

00:15:04.422 --> 00:15:06.089
I know I'm somebody.

00:15:07.237 --> 00:15:08.460
God don't make junk,

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:09.293
right?

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:23.213
A guy talks to me nicely,

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:25.353
right away I think

00:15:25.353 --> 00:15:26.186
he wants something.

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:29.210
Or I get really attached to them.

00:15:30.050 --> 00:15:30.883
To what?

00:15:30.883 --> 00:15:31.716
For what?

00:15:31.716 --> 00:15:32.880
To start beating up again.

00:15:32.880 --> 00:15:33.913
Stealing from me?

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:40.550
Are people talk behind my back?

00:15:40.550 --> 00:15:41.383
You know?

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:46.010
I heard officers call me names.

00:15:50.242 --> 00:15:52.094
And my mama thinks I not anyone

00:15:52.094 --> 00:15:53.294
I'm not even a stranger.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:11.110
And the people that kidnapped me

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:12.293
are still out there.

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:15.733
And they bully me.

00:16:15.733 --> 00:16:17.583
They intimidate me now.

00:16:22.221 --> 00:16:23.818
I don't know what to do.

00:16:23.818 --> 00:16:24.651
- [Mark] What you,

00:16:24.651 --> 00:16:25.484
what do you think is stopping you

00:16:25.484 --> 00:16:27.590
from just getting out of Skid Row?

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:28.423
Changing your life,

00:16:28.423 --> 00:16:29.256
getting a job, getting a-

00:16:29.256 --> 00:16:30.900
- My appearance.

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:31.733
- [Mark] Your what?

00:16:31.733 --> 00:16:32.566
- My appearance.

00:16:32.566 --> 00:16:33.611
- [Mark] What's wrong
with your appearance?

00:16:33.611 --> 00:16:34.764
- Look at me.

00:16:34.764 --> 00:16:35.597
- [Mark] I'm sorry?

00:16:35.597 --> 00:16:37.452
- Look at my skin.

00:16:37.452 --> 00:16:38.285
- [Mark] You're beautiful,

00:16:38.285 --> 00:16:39.702
what's it matter?

00:16:44.994 --> 00:16:45.827
- Just the other day

00:16:45.827 --> 00:16:47.277
someone called me Pizza Face.

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:52.953
I was told I was ugly.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:16:59.520
- [Mark] Do you think that maybe

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:00.840
your self-perception might be

00:17:00.840 --> 00:17:01.810
the biggest problems you have?

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:03.390
- My what?

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:04.223
- [Mark] Your self-perception

00:17:04.223 --> 00:17:05.213
might be the biggest problem

00:17:05.213 --> 00:17:06.046
that you have?

00:17:06.046 --> 00:17:07.830
- What's perception mean?

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:09.373
- [Mark] The way you see yourself.

00:17:10.456 --> 00:17:11.289
- Yeah.

00:17:11.289 --> 00:17:12.122
- [Mark] Because I look at you.

00:17:12.122 --> 00:17:12.955
I see you're,

00:17:12.955 --> 00:17:13.788
You're beautiful.

00:17:13.788 --> 00:17:14.973
I see nothing wrong with you.

00:17:17.555 --> 00:17:18.805
- You're just being nice.

00:17:23.023 --> 00:17:24.240
I had my ex-boyfriend

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:25.320
tell me I was ugly.

00:17:26.896 --> 00:17:28.113
My boyfriend.

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:32.193
And he's disabled.

00:17:35.090 --> 00:17:36.150
I was taking care of him

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:37.620
for two years.

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:39.800
He's confined in a wheelchair.

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:41.147
For what?

00:17:41.147 --> 00:17:41.980
I didn't even get a

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:42.813
thank you.

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:44.623
He took advantage of me.

00:17:44.623 --> 00:17:46.250
He'd throw his diapers at me

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:48.583
and he hit me to be mean.

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:51.543
Disrespect me.

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:54.293
Call me names.

00:18:04.860 --> 00:18:06.607
He took advantage of me.

00:18:08.466 --> 00:18:09.612
But I felt important,

00:18:09.612 --> 00:18:10.445
you know?

00:18:16.067 --> 00:18:18.650
I don't wanna be here anymore.

00:18:18.650 --> 00:18:19.533
I never did.

00:18:22.132 --> 00:18:23.840
But the drugs got a hold of me,

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:24.673
you know?

00:18:24.673 --> 00:18:26.050
(car engine)

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:26.883
When I first came out here,

00:18:26.883 --> 00:18:28.470
I was working crack.

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:29.463
24 years old.

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:32.617
I didn't know what the hell it was.

00:18:32.617 --> 00:18:34.357
But my sister got me involved with it.

00:18:34.357 --> 00:18:36.413
"Taste it you'll like it"

00:18:38.529 --> 00:18:39.390
27 years later,

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:40.263
look at me now.

00:18:41.291 --> 00:18:43.708
(indistinct)

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:47.313
I wanna see if

00:18:47.313 --> 00:18:49.600
I can go onto Ellen DeGeneres.

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:50.720
They say she knows somebody

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:51.870
who'll give me a laser.

00:18:53.140 --> 00:18:54.810
A laser treatment for my face.

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:56.083
I wanna be beautiful.

00:18:57.350 --> 00:18:59.150
I wanna have pretty skin,

00:18:59.150 --> 00:18:59.983
you know?

00:19:01.213 --> 00:19:02.633
And I wanna wake up every morning

00:19:02.633 --> 00:19:04.230
and put makeup on my face

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:05.063
but be scared if

00:19:05.063 --> 00:19:06.396
what if I can't.

00:19:09.964 --> 00:19:11.297
People are mean,

00:19:14.437 --> 00:19:15.270
- [Mark] All right Lydia.

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:17.470
Thank you so much for talking to me.

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:18.303
- Thank you.

00:19:18.303 --> 00:19:19.780
- [Mark] Good luck with everything.

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:20.630
- Thank you Mark.

